    {
        "content": "<p>PR is here everyone, please do review: <a href=\"https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib/pull/265\">https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib/pull/265</a></p>\n<p>Summary of changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ModuleCode generalization for various statements of LinearCode</li>\n<li>New composable APIs for interleaved codes of generic codes</li>\n<li>Refactor coding theory definitions (CA, affine subspace, unified relative distances,...)</li>\n<li>Prove DG25 paper</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If ok, I will refactor AHIV22 with these APIs. Thanks.</p>",
